owing error:\r\nhttps://github.com/StarryWorm/godot/actions/runs/23911165773/job/69733515404\r\n\r\nThis PR fixes this by removing those unused includes.\r\n\r\nI believe these includes were made unused by the changes in #117774, but were not flagged by CI at the time because those files were not in the diff files.\r\nFor `script_language.cpp`, that file was modified by #115157, whose checks were run before my PR (and before clangd-tidy-diff was added to CI). When I synced my fork, the now-unused include got picked up by clangd-tidy-diff. \r\nFor `test_main.cpp`, same story but with #116798 \r\n\r\nThese kinds of second-hand changes caused by include PRs indirectly causing unused includes in unmodified files may happen again in the future. \r\nNote to self and all others working on #111218, when we build these PRs, we might want to run clangd-tidy on the entire codebase.\r\n\r\nEdit:\r\nAlso fixes an XML error caused by recent doc style changes, see comments below","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","number":24,"state":"closed","title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga"